      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Indexing polls the database. ActiveMQ carries transform and rendition traffic\nonly \u2014 a backlog there starves full-text extraction, but it is NOT on the\nindexing path, and the report is not allowed to claim otherwise.",
